  "description": "Add \"listen to this article\" to an Umbraco site, using the neural voices Microsoft Edge uses for its own read-aloud feature. Audio is generated and cached on your own server, word highlighting follows real timings from the engine, and nothing about a listener is stored. Falls back to the browser's built-in speech synthesis when the endpoint is unavailable.",
